g & Construction","employees":192,"city":"Pasir Gudang","summary":"Ecoscience International Berhad engages in the construction of plants and facilities in Gabon, Indonesia, Malaysia, and internationally. It operates through Construction of Plants and Facilities; Fabrication of Equipment; and Supply of Material and Equipment segments. The company engages in construction of palm oil mills and its facilities and covers downstream processes of palm oil industry, such as refineries where crude palm oil is processed. It also provides fabrication of palm oil mill and fabrication and installation of sterilizer systems. In addition, the company is involved in turnkey projects in building and commissioning; in-house fabrication of equipment; construction of biogas plants; and installation of electrostatic precipitator. Further, it engages in supply of materials and equipment, spare parts, and maintenance services. The company was incorporated in 2020 and is headquartered in Pasir Gudang, Malaysia.","zh":"Ecoscience International Berhad 是一家总部位于马来西亚 Pasir Gudang 的公司，成立于 2020 年，业务覆盖 Gabon、Indonesia、Malaysia 及国际市场，主要涉及工厂与设施建设、设备制造以及材料与设备供应。","lines":["工厂与设施建设：建设棕榈油厂及其设施，并涵盖棕榈油下游加工环节如炼油厂，客户为棕榈油行业企业。","设备制造：制造棕榈油厂设备，以及杀菌系统的制造与安装，服务棕榈油厂相关客户。","交钥匙工程与专项建设：提供建筑与调试交钥匙项目、内部设备制造、沼气厂建设及静电除尘器安装。","材料与设备供应及维护：供应材料、设备、备件并提供维护服务。"],"lines_en":["Construction of plants and facilities: builds palm oil mills and facilities, covering downstream processes such as refineries, for palm oil industry clients.","Fabrication of equipment: fabricates palm oil mill equipment and manufactures and installs sterilizer systems for palm oil mill clients.","Turnkey projects and specialized construction: provides turnkey building and commissioning, in-house equipment fabrication, biogas plant construction, and electrostatic precipitator installation.","Supply of material and equipment and maintenance: supplies materials, equipment, spare parts, and provides maintenance services."]}}